{"name":"表单","description":"网页或软件里让用户填写并提交一组信息的区域，比如注册、下单或修改资料 · 例如注册账号时，用户会填写手机号、验证码和密码，再点“注册”。填错的内容要在对应输入框附近说明；提交后还要明确账号是否真的创建成功。 先知道 输入框 Input 按钮 Button","quote":"帮我做个注册页，用户填完信息点提交那种。","agentPrompt":"请把邮箱、验证码和密码整理成一次提交的注册表单。错误放在对应字段附近，提交时显示处理中并防止重复点击，最后分别显示成功或失败。请验证空值、格式错误和注册成功三种情况。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-form\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>表单<span>Form</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">帮我做个注册页，用户填完信息点提交那种。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">网页或软件里让用户填写并提交一组信息的区域，比如注册、下单或修改资料</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如注册账号时，用户会填写手机号、验证码和密码，再点“注册”。填错的内容要在对应输入框附近说明；提交后还要明确账号是否真的创建成功。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"button\">按钮 <b>Button</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"form-demo\">\n    <div class=\"form-item\"><label class=\"form-label\">姓名</label><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"林小hu\"></div>\n    <div class=\"form-item err\"><label class=\"form-label\">邮箱</label><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"ans-studio@abc\"><span class=\"form-error\">✕ 邮箱格式不正确</span></div>\n    <div class=\"form-item\"><label class=\"form-label\">城市</label><span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>深圳</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"深圳\">\n        <span>深圳</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"广州\">\n        <span>广州</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"杭州\">\n        <span>杭州</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span></div>\n    <div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</button></div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把邮箱、验证码和密码整理成一次提交的注册表单。错误放在对应字段附近，提交时显示处理中并防止重复点击，最后分别显示成功或失败。请验证空值、格式错误和注册成功三种情况。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>表单<small>Form</small></span><b>≠</b><span>字段组（Fieldset）</span></div><p>表单（Form）收集并提交整项任务；字段组（Fieldset）只把表单里相互相关的几个字段分成一组，通常会用图例标题（legend）写出组名。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>登录注册</b>：账号 + 密码 + 提交</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-input \">ans-studio</span><span class=\"mk-input \">••••••••</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">登录</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>资料设置</b>：一排字段，改完保存</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">姓名</span><span class=\"mk-input \">林小hu</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">邮箱</span><span class=\"mk-input \"><em>you@example.com</em></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>提交前校验</b>：格式不对当场指出</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">邮箱</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"border-color:var(--red)\">ans-studio@abc</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);padding-left:40px\">✕ 邮箱格式不正确</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>组合多种控件</b>：输入框、选择器、开关混编</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">姓名</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:80px\">林小hu</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">城市</span><span class=\"mk-select\">深圳<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">通知</span><span class=\"mk-switch on\"><i></i></span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>只有独立搜索字段</b>：直接使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\" aria-label=\"输入框 Input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a>，无需增加表单框架</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">搜索表单</div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-input focus\" style=\"flex:1\"><em>输入关键词…</em></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">提交</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">单个搜索字段不需要额外的表单结构</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>大量字段集中在一页</b>：按任务分组或分步填写</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:64%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:74%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:86%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>校验规则藏起来</b>：提交失败才告诉用户哪错了</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">密码</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:90px\">123</span></div><span class=\"mk-toast\"><i class=\"mk-dot red\"></i>提交失败：密码至少 8 位</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">规则提前不说，提交才报错</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>只是展示信息</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/descriptions?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"descriptions\" aria-label=\"描述列表 Descriptions\">描述列表 <b>Descriptions</b></a>，不要使用禁用输入框</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">版本</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3)\">v2.4.0</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">作者</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3)\">ans-studio</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">只读信息塞输入框，用户以为能改</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"form-demo\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><div class=\"form-item err\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\"><label class=\"form-label\">邮箱</label></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"control\"><input class=\"demo-input\" value=\"ans-studio@abc\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"error\"><span class=\"form-error\">✕ 邮箱格式不正确</span></span></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\"><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"item\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">表单项</span><span class=\"pe\">Form Item</span></button><span class=\"pd\">一个字段的完整单元：标签 + 控件 + 报错</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">标签</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">告诉用户这里填什么</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"control\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">控件</span><span class=\"pe\">Control</span></button><span class=\"pd\">真正干活的填写与选择，什么都能放</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"error\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">报错信息</span><span class=\"pe\">Error</span></button><span class=\"pd\">校验不通过时的提示，紧跟对应字段</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"actions\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">操作区</span><span class=\"pe\">Actions</span></button><span class=\"pd\">提交 / 取消，主按钮放最重要的动作</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">水平布局<span>Horizontal</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"form-demo\" style=\"width:250px\"><div class=\"form-item\"><label class=\"form-label\">姓名</label><input class=\"demo-input\" placeholder=\"林小hu\"></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">字段较少且页面较宽时，可将标签放在左侧</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">垂直布局<span>Vertical</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"form-demo form-vertical\" style=\"width:250px\"><div class=\"form-item\"><label class=\"form-label\">姓名</label><input class=\"demo-input\" placeholder=\"林小hu\"></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">字段较多或页面较窄时，将标签放在输入框上方</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">内联布局<span>Inline</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"form-demo form-inline\"><div class=\"form-item\"><input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:150px\" placeholder=\"关键词\"></div><div class=\"form-item\"><span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>全部状态</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-custom-select-option data-value=\"全部状态\">\n        <span>全部状态</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\" rol